&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;The investigation began on January 30, 2026, at a residence in the 4600 block of Dark Forest Place NE, when a woman, 70, of Salem, was found deceased under suspicious circumstances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
