&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SALEM, Ore. &mdash;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;On February 7, 2026, at approximately&amp;nbsp;01:35&amp;nbsp;a.m., officers responded to Mikey's Bar and Grill,&amp;nbsp;at 155 Liberty Street NE,&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;a report of a fight involving multiple subjects, with mention of a firearm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
